@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Upload (the file path is relative to this examples directory)
POST {{baseUrl}}/artifacts
X-Request-ID: example-upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ArtifactBoundary

--ArtifactBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./hello.txt
--ArtifactBoundary--

### Replace the UUID with the id from the upload response
@artifactId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
GET {{baseUrl}}/artifacts/{{artifactId}}

### Download content
GET {{baseUrl}}/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/content
Accept: application/octet-stream

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/health/ready
